      "title": "Aravali Securities & Finance Limited Announces Board and Committee Changes, Effective January 13, 2026",
      "body": "Aravali Securities & Finance Limited, in its Board meeting held on January 13, 2026, approved the appointment of Ms. Chandra Lekha Poddar as an Additional Director (Non-Executive Director) and Chairperson (Non-Executive) of the Board of Directors of the Company, with effect from January 13, 2026, to hold office up to the date of the ensuing Annual General Meeting. The Board also approved the appointment of Mr. Shiv Poddar as an Additional Director (Non-Executive Director) of the Company with effect from January 13, 2026, to hold office up to the date of the ensuing Annual General Meeting. The Board took note of the resignation of Mr. Ranjan Kumar Poddar as Managing Director effective January 14, 2026, and Mr. Devashish Poddar as Non-Executive Non-Independent Director effective January 14, ",
